            <ArticleTitle>The mechanisms of IL-17A on promoting tumor metastasis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>360-369</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/08830185.2017.1356296</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In recent decades, extensive studies have indicated that IL-17A plays an important role in tumor progression and metastasis, but the underlying mechanisms are not immediately clear. In this review, we examined the literature from the recent years concerning the study of IL-17A in four kinds of tumor transfer paths, including hematogenous metastasis, lymphatic metastasis, local invasion and transcoelomic metastasis, to summarize the roles and underlying mechanisms of IL-17A on tumor metastasis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
